{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1723161600, "end_date": 1723766399, "month_true_total": 10632, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:15:33 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "172210867", "author": {"steamid": "76561198258948777", "personaname": "BRD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198258948777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 26603, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 290, "playtime_at_review": 4923, "last_played": 1787797317, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite my issues with the bots repeatedly knocking me down, I have fun. Good experience 7/10.\n\n\n\n\nWish I has friends to play with.", "timestamp_created": 1723765646, "timestamp_updated": 1723765646, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172210816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020283179", "personaname": "PFC Kachowski", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/toxic_avenger_/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1861, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1466, "last_played": 1784504451, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I feel like this game scratches an itch. It quickly drops you into the action with a fairly easy to semi-challenging gameplay model as you progress through the difficulties. The glaringly obvious issue is that it does get repetitive. There are weekly rotations which take you to different planets with different missions which is refreshing. There is a meta for items and armor, and once you have what you need to counter each faction/unit type, the missions get easier.\n\nThe devs listen to the players, and know when to not listen to the players. Once you get past the level progression, there really isn't much past that and unfortunately the \"BattlePass\" system is mediocre. With that being said though, I can't fault this game for executing this formula pretty flawlessly. All in all, visually it's beautiful and it doesn't miss its mark at being a great game to run around and blow ♥♥♥♥ up with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1723765585, "timestamp_updated": 1723765585, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172210683", "author": {"steamid": "76561198373819824", "personaname": "Cyclone Joker", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198373819824/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 40017, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1558, "playtime_at_review": 4488, "last_played": 1788066738, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "english", "review": "People like to complain about everything...", "timestamp_created": 1723765411, "timestamp_updated": 1723765411, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.487582236528396606", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "172210660", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019338776", "personaname": "Lysander", "persona_status": "online",